:`BULLDOZER PUNCH!`,special2:`DEMOLITION KICK!`,finisher:`NON-STOP DOZER COMBO!`,sweep:`DOZER SWEEP!`,uppercut:`HARD HAT UPPERCUT!`,grab:`BULLDOZER SLAM!`,roundhouse:`CEMENT ROUNDHOUSE!`},superName:`DOZER KA DHAMAKA`,superDesc:`Eyes glow red, a bulldozer charges in, raises its front loader bucket and slams it down 3 times on the opponent for 30% damage.`,introLine:`Bulldozer taiyaar hai!`,winLine:`Kaam chalu, bulldozer chalu!`,facePhoto:`faces/yogi.webp?v=20261101_smooth`,modelHeight:.97,dance:{label:`DOZER KA SWAG!`,colors:[15751680,16777215,16763200]}},nitin:{id:`nitin`,name:`TOLL MAN`,fullName:`Toll Man`,party:`Team Highway`,accent:`#ff9a1f`,look:{skin:13144426,skinShade:11039312,hair:1841689,hairStyle:`side-part`,beard:2761760,beardStyle:`none`,brows:2038295,topStyle:`tshirt`,top:16184558,jacket:16184558,pants:15921386,shoes:3811870,glasses:!1,shoulders:1.15,belly:1.25,scale:1.02},walkFwd:2.2,walkBack:1.7,jumpV:7.6,jumpVx:2.5,damageMul:1,fightClips:!0,moveNames:{special1:`TOLL TAX UPPERCUT!`,special2:`FLYOVER KICK!`,finisher:`FULL SPEED COMBO!`,sweep:`SPEED BREAKER SWEEP!`,uppercut:`UDGHATAN UPPERCUT!`,grab:`HIGHWAY TAKEDOWN!`,roundhouse:`RING ROAD ROUNDHOUSE!`},superName:`GADDHA BLAST`,superDesc:`Opens a pothole under the opponent, turns sugarcane into E20 in his machine, pours it in, flicks a matchstick and walks away from the fire, for 30% damage.`,introLine:`Toll bharo, aage badho!`,winLine:`Highway ban gaya, kaam ho gaya!`,facePhoto:`faces/nitin.webp?v=20261101_smooth`,dance:{label:`ZINGAAT!`,colors:[16751135,16777215,1280008]}},ravi:{id:`ravi`,name:`SUTTI BABU`,fullName:`Sutti Babu`,party:`Team Viral`,accent:`#8b5cf6`,look:{skin:12157018,skinShade:10118726,hair:1380623,hairStyle:`side-part`,beard:1906194,beardStyle:`none`,brows:1709073,topStyle:`tshirt`,top:2042442,jacket:2042442,pants:14207144,shoes:4860954,glasses:!1,shoulders:1.05,belly:1.1,scale:1},modelHeight:.817,walkFwd:2.25,walkBack:1.75,jumpV:7.6,jumpVx:2.5,damageMul:1,fightClips:!0,danceIntro:!0,