ponent, the fans hoist them up, and a golden knight rams them out of the air. Checkmate, for 30% damage.`,introLine:`Chaal chal di gayi hai.`,winLine:`Shah-maat. Chronology samajh aayi?`,facePhoto:`faces/amit.webp?v=20261107_real`,dance:{label:`GARBA CHAAL!`,colors:[1976906,16777215,13934615]}},dhruv:{id:`dhruv`,name:`FACT BHAI`,fullName:`Fact Bhai`,party:`Team Doston`,accent:`#22d3ee`,look:{skin:13605490,skinShade:11566168,hair:1709330,hairStyle:`side-part`,beard:2761244,beardStyle:`none`,brows:2038295,topStyle:`tshirt`,top:2042436,jacket:2042436,pants:13153418,shoes:15921906,glasses:!1,shoulders:1.05,belly:.9,scale:1.04},modelHeight:1,headScale:1.1,walkFwd:2.35,walkBack:1.8,jumpV:7.6,jumpVx:2.5,damageMul:1,fightClips:!0,moveNames:{jab:`FACT JAB!`,cross:`COUNTER-POINT CROSS!`,kick:`FRONT-PAGE KICK!`,uppercut:`DATA UPPERCUT!`,roundhouse:`THUMBNAIL CRESCENT!`,finisher:`FLIP THE NARRATIVE!`,lowJab:`FOOTNOTE BODY SHOT!`,sweep:`MYTH-BUSTER SWEEP!`,special1:`BULLET POINTS!`,special2:`VIRAL FLYING KICK!`,grab:`FACT-CHECK LOCK!`},superName:`DOOMSCROLL`,superDesc:`"Aaj mood nahi hai": his MOOD meter drains to zero. "Ise kal dekhte hain": calendar pages (KAL, PARSO, KABHI NAHI) slice into the opponent. A giant phone appears behind them, his German Shepherds burst out of a reel in slow motion, and on "scroll" the phone tips over and flattens the opponent, for 30% damage.`,introLine:`Namaskar doston! Aaj ka topic: tumhari haar.`,winLine:`Facts ke saath, doston. Video pasand aaye toh share karna!`,facePhoto:`faces/dhruv.webp?v=20261107_real`,dance:{label:`HARYANVI THUMKA!`,colors:[2282478,2042436,16777215]}}},Ei=e=>e===`modi`?`rahul`:`modi`,Di=`rootY.rootZ.hipsF.hipsT.hipsS.spineF.spineT.spineS.chestF.chestT.headF.headT.headS.lShF.lShO.lShT.lEl.lHand.lWf.lWr.rShF.rShO.rShT.rEl.rHand.rWf.rWr.lThF.lThO.lKn.lAnk.rThF.rThO.rKn.rAnk`.split(`.`);function Oi(){let e={};for(let t of Di)e[t]=0;return e}function ki(e){return{...e}}function P(e,t){return{...e,...t}}function F(e,t,n,r=Oi()