 expressway pe ladenge." — Toll Man camp`,`"Toll naka pe traffic tha." — Toll Man camp`],ravi:[`"Main late nahi, bas thoda jaldi haar gaya." — Babu camp`,`"Shooting chal rahi thi, retake hoga." — Babu camp`,`"Interval hua hai, climax abhi aayega." — Babu camp`],lalu:[`"Signal laal tha, isliye ruk gaye." — Raja camp`,`"Gaadi late thi, haar nahi." — Raja camp`,`"Agli baar superfast se aayenge." — Raja camp`],amit:[`"Yeh haar nahi, agli chaal ki taiyaari hai." — Ghar Mantri camp`,`"Booth-wise review ke baad baat karenge." — Ghar Mantri camp`,`"Pyaade aage gaye, raja abhi baaki hai." — Ghar Mantri camp`],dhruv:[`"Part 2 mein poora sach aayega." — Fact Bhai camp`,`"Algorithm ne reach kam kar di." — Fact Bhai camp`,`"Sources description mein hain, doston." — Fact Bhai camp`],mbapu:[`"Shanti kamzori nahi, strategy hai." — Mbapu camp`,`"Main sirf aapka sabar dekh raha tha." — Mbapu camp`,`"Aaj ka sabak poora hua." — Mbapu camp`]};function Xo(e,t,n,r=Math.random){let i=Math.max(...n),a=Math.min(...n),o=i-a>=2;return{masthead:Io([`THE DAILY JUMLA`,`SANSAD TIMES`,`BREAKING BAKWAS`,`THE KURSI EXPRESS`],r),headline:o?{modi:`MITRAMAN SWEEPS SANSAD!`,rahul:`YATRA BOY WALKS TO VICTORY!`,didi:`DEEDEE STORMS DELHI!`,trump:`TARIFF TAAU TAXES SANSAD!`,yogi:`DOZER DADA FLATTENS SANSAD!`,nitin:`TOLL MAN PAVES OVER SANSAD!`,mbapu:`MBAPU CALMS THE SANSAD!`,ravi:`SUTTI BABU STEALS THE SHOW!`,lalu:`RAIL RAJA RUNS OVER SANSAD!`,amit:`GHAR MANTRI CHECKMATES SANSAD!`,dhruv:`FACT BHAI EXPLAINS SANSAD AWAY!`}[e]:{modi:`MITRAMAN SCRAPES THROUGH!`,rahul:`YATRA BOY WINS THRILLER!`,didi:`DEEDEE SITS ON VICTORY!`,trump:`TARIFF TAAU CLOSES THE DEAL!`,yogi:`DOZER DADA WINS BY A WHISKER!`,nitin:`TOLL MAN WINS IN THE FAST LANE!`,mbapu:`MBAPU WINS WITH SABAR & SHANTI!`,ravi:`SUTTI BABU WINS IN THE LAST REEL!`,lalu:`RAIL RAJA ARRIVES JUST IN TIME!`,amit:`GHAR MANTRI WINS BY ONE BOOTH!`,dhruv:`FACT BHAI WINS ON THE LAST SLIDE!`}[e],sub:o?`LANDSLIDE ${i}–${a} · Opposition in shock`:`NAIL-BITER ${i}–${a} · Rec